  "short_description": "人人都在賭，其中一人在出老千。在這款3至8人的社交推理遊戲裡，老千的眼鏡能看出下一把押哪裡會中，警衛則觀察牌桌、判讀賭注，決定誰該吃霰彈槍。開著近距離語音，說謊、偷竊、虛張聲勢樣樣來。",
  "short_description_en": "Everyone is gambling. One player is cheating. In this social deduction game for 3 to 8 players, the Cheater uses glasses that reveal the next winning bet while the Security Guard studies the tables, reads the bets and decides who gets the shotgun. Lie, steal and larp over proximity chat.",
